  "query": "-- 订单聊天：游标之前的一页，新的在前（调用方再按时间正序返回）。$1 order_id, $2 游标（不含）, $3 条数\nSELECT id, order_id, sender_id, kind, body, image, warn, prev_hash, hash, created_at\nFROM order_messages\nWHERE order_id = $1 AND id < $2\nORDER BY id DESC\nLIMIT $3\n",
